                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3fce0994-2183-37db-9d15-e51c3f9a04bd",
                        "entry_id": "69fee88f-5f74-37ab-bfb1-2fb6fce0e87a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "состояние самодовольного человека; довольство самим собой"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2e7ced2-d033-452b-ab54-fd1b77904887",
                                "sense_id": "3fce0994-2183-37db-9d15-e51c3f9a04bd",
                                "text": "Вообще Тейлор не такой уж плохой парень; временами всё портит его самодовольство, уверенность, что ему всё можно, что ни одна девушка не устоит перед ним, да ещё его бахвальство рыбака и яхтсмена, которое, впрочем, мы ему прощали как вполне дозволенные человеческие слабости."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "48b800c0-cb55-411f-aa0e-786cdc1a3b55",
                        "source_entry_id": "69fee88f-5f74-37ab-bfb1-2fb6fce0e87a",
                        "source_sense_id": "3fce0994-2183-37db-9d15-e51c3f9a04bd",
                        "target_lang_word": "self-satisfaction",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "self-satisfaction",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "97670516-9077-3c6b-9f34-eb67cac44192",
                                        "entry_id": "6cc3b66d-979a-3f6b-a33f-66d8dcc90d45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being excessively pleased with oneself; smugness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06a5b058-af53-35ba-add3-cb5675f38795",
                                        "entry_id": "6cc3b66d-979a-3f6b-a33f-66d8dcc90d45",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A feeling of fulfillment or contentment with respect to one's own accomplishments or situation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "648fe863-80ef-4cc3-ae7c-2218d635c0ed",
                                                "sense_id": "06a5b058-af53-35ba-add3-cb5675f38795",
                                                "text": "Without being in any way smug she was radiant with self-satisfaction and well-doing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2e6cbd57-77fa-47d8-8213-4edc9d30006f",
                        "source_entry_id": "69fee88f-5f74-37ab-bfb1-2fb6fce0e87a",
                        "source_sense_id": "3fce0994-2183-37db-9d15-e51c3f9a04bd",
                        "target_lang_word": "complacency",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "complacency",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a7c4b95-76a2-3381-87f3-bb0d92f978bb",
                                        "entry_id": "3fb58c2f-76ec-369c-925d-480a44da5fa9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A feeling of contented self-satisfaction, especially when unaware of upcoming trouble."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "895c042a-bd17-4243-b635-e1199823bfd1",
                                                "sense_id": "9a7c4b95-76a2-3381-87f3-bb0d92f978bb",
                                                "text": "Others proclaim the infirmities of a great man with satisfaction and complacency, if they discover none of the like in themselves."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f61213e-5685-44e3-99e8-2b105fa42476",
                                                "sense_id": "9a7c4b95-76a2-3381-87f3-bb0d92f978bb",
                                                "text": "[…] looking at Mr. George Osborne's pale interesting countenance, and those beautiful black, curling, shining whiskers, which the young gentleman himself regarded with no ordinary complacency, she thought in her little heart that in His Majesty's army, or in the wide world, there never was such a face or such a hero."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88082f1d-0180-4b1f-a3cc-0ffb5856ec72",
                                                "sense_id": "9a7c4b95-76a2-3381-87f3-bb0d92f978bb",
                                                "text": "There was something pathetic in his concentration as if his complacency, more acute than of old, was not enough to him any more. When, almost immediately, the telephone rang inside and the butler left the porch Daisy seized upon the momentary interruption and leaned toward me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d33f9f7a-86b7-4f8d-bf57-299ae3c02632",
                                                "sense_id": "9a7c4b95-76a2-3381-87f3-bb0d92f978bb",
                                                "text": "\"However, incidents such as the derailment at Walton-on-Thames clearly show us that there is no room for complacency.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7061e89f-8d81-3eff-9ed9-6885b9280f7f",
                                        "entry_id": "3fb58c2f-76ec-369c-925d-480a44da5fa9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of self-satisfaction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a28e5ca3-eb99-321d-89cf-546fa30dff00",
                                        "entry_id": "3fb58c2f-76ec-369c-925d-480a44da5fa9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Passivity as a result of contentment with the current situation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
